Z||000001||1FST2M6||11-01-2000||03:51 PM||||Type: In line-4, aluminum block <BR>Displacement: 2157cc <BR>Compression ratio: 10.0:1 <BR>Valve Train: DOHC, 4 valves per cylinder, variable valve timing <BR>Power (SAE net): 190bhp @ 6800rpm <BR>Torque: 158lb-ft @ 5500rpm  <BR>Curb weight: 2932<BR>0-60   7.5    <P>from vtec.net.. I could pull one in my SE at a drag strip. but the GT will pull one till about 70 and he starts to leave me...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstsig1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 11-01-2000).]||||reg||1
